# URL stability. A page's URL comes from its filename, so renaming a product
# or landing page changes its address and breaks Google's index and any link
# the client has shared. Rule: do not rename a live slug. If a rename is
# unavoidable, keep the old address working by adding a line here:
#
#   /products/old-slug/   /products/new-slug/   301
#
# (Cloudflare Pages reads this file. The apex -> www redirect is a Cloudflare
# Redirect Rule in the dashboard, not here.)

# The client corrected the variety: what we listed as Black Pearl is Blue Sapphire.
/products/granite-black-pearl/   /products/granite-blue-sapphire/   301
